  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACBF st&#xf6;der kapacitetsutvecklingsinsatser i Afrika (i ett 40-tal      l&#xe4;nder) riktade mot f&#xf6;rvaltning, civila samh&#xe4;llet,                    forskningsinstitutioner och parlament. ACBF fungerar som kanal och    samordnare f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till kapacitetsutveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACBF supports capacity development in Africa (in about 40             countries)in the areas of public administration, civil society,       researh institutions and parliaments. ACBF functions as a channel for and coordinator of capacity development support.</narrative>
  </description>
